# Logs Directory

This directory contains system logs in JSONL format.

## Files

- `system.log` - Main system event log (JSONL format)
- `morning-review.log` - Output from morning-review.sh cron job

## Log Rotation

Logs are automatically rotated to keep only the last 7 days.
Run `scripts/log-system.sh rotate` to manually rotate.

## Privacy

⚠️ **Do not commit logs to version control.**
Logs may contain sensitive operational data.
